  <description>
    <p>Measure the drawings. Count the work. Price the job. TakeoffCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in TakeoffCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Start a takeoff and open a plan set</li>
      <li>Set the scale</li>
      <li>Create takeoff items</li>
      <li>Snap to the drawing's lines</li>
      <li>Measure linear runs</li>
      <li>Measure areas with cut-outs</li>
      <li>Count by hand</li>
      <li>Auto count a symbol</li>
      <li>Copy, paste and duplicate marks</li>
      <li>Assemblies and formulas</li>
      <li>Bid areas</li>
      <li>Read quantities and the estimate</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
